## ros2 source issue with default remote shell

Command:
ssh -p 37878 root@192.168.1.11 'source /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash; ...; ros2 topic list | sort; ros2 node list || true'

Output:
/opt/ros/humble/setup.bash:.:11: no such file or directory: /root/setup.sh
/opt/ros/humble/local_setup.bash:.:11: no such file or directory: /root/local_setup.sh
not found: "/root/local_setup.bash"
zsh:1: command not found: ros2
zsh:1: command not found: ros2

Resolution:
Use remote `bash -lc` for ROS2 commands because root's login shell is `/usr/bin/zsh`.

